{"game": "terminull-brigade", "language": "english", "appid": 3104410, "month": "2025-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1757289600, "end_date": 1757980799, "month_true_total": 129, "quota": 11, "returned": 11, "pulled_at": "2026-09-03 02:31:57 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "204413027", "author": {"steamid": "76561198836295756", "personaname": "4DOP", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Gryf4DOP/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 88, "playtime_forever": 744, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 742, "last_played": 1766961730, "avatar": "3cfeca93b629f83aff9e82e95959f03732727989"}, "language": "english", "review": "Update on this review as season 2 dropped and I decided to hop back in for a few hours. This is unplayable. I have never in my life expiranced such bad shuttering on a game. \n\nUnacceptable.\n\nThis is a super fun well designed game the problem is there is nothing new to do after 10 hours and while most games like give you rewards every time you log in this only does it for a week. I would recommend this if it were 40$ and was an actual video game but right now it seems to have been abandoned with nothing to come out in the future. Too bad. A Fun time for a few hours with some friends. Dont spend any money on it. Have a good one folks, wish there was a reason to keep playing but there just isnt.", "timestamp_created": 1757957407, "timestamp_updated": 1764986047, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.557760000228881836", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204394060", "author": {"steamid": "76561199499217906", "personaname": "Weedowmaker", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199499217906/", "n