": 1757764954, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204219693", "author": {"steamid": "76561198411089951", "personaname": "Inakseptible", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ifuckyamomlastnight/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 229, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 162, "last_played": 1767718729, "avatar": "60c254cdeadf3a73cf7a3767bbaa9c6aa41ba1b2"}, "language": "english", "review": "All you need to know is that this is a PVE shooter , the game has huge potential and is so fun and devs are working actively in fixing bugs.", "timestamp_created": 1757751335, "timestamp_updated": 1757751335, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.471803009510040283", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 3, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "204200343", "author": {"steamid": "76561197993255516", "personaname": "Geata", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197993255516/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 823, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 823, "last_played": 1757726211, "avatar": "5296d115b35c52bb14fb0e36632b41a80e780a9c"}, "language": "english", "review": "As of writing, this 2 month old game has 500 peak players and 100 average players. The developer is also radio silent. \r\n\r\nMost of the players have freezing issues where you'll suddenly get a 500+ ping for 2-3 seconds and then the game will catch up. This is annoying on low difficulties. It all but guarantees a run end. \r\n\r\nAll of which is a shame! I love the art style. The game play loop is fun. There are quite a few systems to engage with to keep you playing. \r\n\r\nBut no amount of engaging game play will make people suffer these freezes. This includes me. Once you hit Difficulty 7 on the standard mode, the game truly becomes a test of skill. This means a freeze will nearly if not guarantee you die. \r\n\r\nThere are other nitpicks. The game does a horrible job explaining its systems. You gain a bunch of resources that aren't used until you've put 5+ hours into the game, so you're confused as to what you're collecting. There are weird gacha mechanics for the summer skins, but seemingly no way to earn pulls besides paying real money. The event screens obviously just load in a website to the game window, so click-to-action time is super high. You'll think the game is frozen because 2-3 seconds can pass in one of these event screens before whatever you clicked on does something.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure if this is an asset flip or whatever, but the graphics are great. The game play loop is fun. But you won't get far if you're in the majority of those who get the freezes.", "timestamp_created": 1757726806, "timestamp_updated": 1757726806, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.509803950786590576", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1753830060", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "204193522", "author": {"steamid": "76561198041041912", "personaname": "WuduMann", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WuduMann/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 1865, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1657, "last_played": 1758991117, "avatar": "7674eb0e61d9d865f432089d